  {
    "text": "is that impulse to",
    "start": 2152.96,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "uh to connect rather than control.",
    "start": 2156.24,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "And",
    "start": 2161.04,
    "duration": 6.079
  },
  {
    "text": "Michelle um Michelle McDonald um",
    "start": 2162.88,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "uh talks about karmic karmic knots often",
    "start": 2167.119,
    "duration": 7.921
  },
  {
    "text": "these kind of places of deep pain where",
    "start": 2171.28,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "the dharma simply does not seem like it",
    "start": 2175.04,
    "duration": 4.799
  },
  {
    "text": "ever",
    "start": 2178.16,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "penetrates. It never soaks in.",
    "start": 2179.839,
    "duration": 6.721
  },
  {
    "text": "And we might know the issue that not",
    "start": 2184.16,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "we've tried hard to work with it. We've",
    "start": 2186.56,
    "duration": 4.08
  },
  {
    "text": "done",
    "start": 2188.72,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "everything. We've brought all of our",
    "start": 2190.64,
    "duration": 5.199
  },
  {
    "text": "effort and sincerity and mindfulness and",
    "start": 2193.04,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "loving kindness and compassion. Tried to",
    "start": 2195.839,
    "duration": 5.921
  },
  {
    "text": "feel it in our body. Tried to apply the",
    "start": 2198.16,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "antidotes and tried to deconstruct it",
    "start": 2201.76,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "and untangle and everything.",
    "start": 2204.72,
    "duration": 7.56
  },
  {
    "text": "There it is.",
    "start": 2208.8,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "Michelle says, um,",
    "start": 2212.64,
    "duration": 5.199
  },
  {
    "text": "we're learning to have that deep",
    "start": 2215.359,
    "duration": 5.041
  },
  {
    "text": "unconditional acceptance. We're not",
    "start": 2217.839,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "trying to get rid of it. With a karmic",
    "start": 2220.4,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "knot, if you manage to open to it, try",
    "start": 2223.599,
    "duration": 4.881
  },
  {
    "text": "to keep some relationship with the",
    "start": 2226.48,
    "duration": 3.84
  },
  {
    "text": "anchor.",
    "start": 2228.48,
    "duration": 4.879
  },
  {
    "text": "The line between accepting it and trying",
    "start": 2230.32,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "to get rid of it, it's very thin.",
    "start": 2233.359,
    "duration": 7.041
  },
  {
    "text": "That's the definition of a karmic knot.",
    "start": 2237.04,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "You'll think you're there because you're",
    "start": 2240.4,
    "duration": 3.84
  },
  {
    "text": "accepting it, but that's not how it",
    "start": 2242.32,
    "duration": 3.519
  },
  {
    "text": "works.",
    "start": 2244.24,
    "duration": 3.28
  },
  {
    "text": "That little part of you that wants to",
    "start": 2245.839,
    "duration": 4.0
  },
  {
    "text": "get rid of it slips in. You don't see",
    "start": 2247.52,
    "duration": 5.599
  },
  {
    "text": "it. And all you're doing is reinforcing",
    "start": 2249.839,
    "duration": 6.561
  },
  {
    "text": "a version by staying with it.",
    "start": 2253.119,
    "duration": 6.881
  },
  {
    "text": "I believe our karmic knots are are",
    "start": 2256.4,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "teachers in this life.",
    "start": 2260.0,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "It's not going to open unless you truly",
    "start": 2262.64,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "want a relationship with it.",
    "start": 2266.48,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "truly want a relationship with it.",
    "start": 2271.92,
    "duration": 11.199
  },
  {
    "text": "That's a way of talking about interest",
    "start": 2277.2,
    "duration": 7.68
  },
  {
    "text": "and",
    "start": 2283.119,
    "duration": 5.641
  },
  {
    "text": "curiosity investigation.",
    "start": 2284.88,
    "duration": 3.88
  },
  {
    "text": "When the interest isn't there,",
    "start": 2291.359,
    "duration": 8.321
  },
  {
    "text": "don't don't pretend it is.",
    "start": 2295.52,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "We can't command ourself to",
    "start": 2299.68,
    "duration": 7.72
  },
  {
    "text": "get interested",
    "start": 2304.0,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "and",
    "start": 2307.52,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "we can't fake it. There is a certain",
    "start": 2310.079,
    "duration": 6.721
  },
  {
    "text": "measure of patience. We keep practicing.",
    "start": 2312.88,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "We keep listening to dharma. We keep",
    "start": 2316.8,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "opening our hearts up to it. We keep",
    "start": 2319.68,
    "duration": 8.399
  },
  {
    "text": "close to spiritual friends.",
    "start": 2322.72,
    "duration": 8.32
  },
  {
    "text": "Keep close to sa",
    "start": 2328.079,
    "duration": 7.841
  },
  {
    "text": "and at some point something happens.",
    "start": 2331.04,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "It might have been a week of feeling",
    "start": 2335.92,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "uninspired or years.",
    "start": 2338.8,
    "duration": 8.64
  },
  {
    "text": "But at some point someone else's being",
    "start": 2343.119,
    "duration": 7.761
  },
  {
    "text": "will affect you in a deep way. Something",
    "start": 2347.44,
    "duration": 9.2
  },
  {
    "text": "they did or said or some way they were.",
    "start": 2350.88,
    "duration": 10.8
  },
  {
    "text": "and their freedom or their courage,",
    "start": 2356.64,
    "duration": 9.12
  },
  {
    "text": "their suffering, their love, something",
    "start": 2361.68,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "will ignite",
    "start": 2365.76,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "sincerity,",
    "start": 2369.2,
    "duration": 3.68
  },
  {
    "text": "interest,",
    "start": 2370.96,
    "duration": 4.399
  },
  {
    "text": "willingness. Again,",
    "start": 2372.88,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "maybe it's the preciousness of our own",
    "start": 2375.359,
    "duration": 8.361
  },
  {
    "text": "human birth that bears down on us.",
    "start": 2378.72,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And then we get interested.",
    "start": 2385.68,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "We get interested.",
    "start": 2389.52,
    "duration": 7.319
  },
  {
    "text": "It's from our own heart.",
    "start": 2392.4,
    "duration": 4.439
  },
  {
    "text": "And uh",
    "start": 2397.68,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "and then we just follow that thread",
    "start": 2399.92,
    "duration": 7.439
  },
  {
    "text": "and the",
    "start": 2404.56,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "when we're not making demands of the",
    "start": 2407.359,
    "duration": 5.121
  },
  {
    "text": "practice,",
    "start": 2410.24,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "the blessings of practice start raining",
    "start": 2412.48,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "down.",
    "start": 2415.04,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "The love gets richer. The sense of",
    "start": 2416.96,
    "duration": 5.119
  },
  {
    "text": "goodness becomes more and more",
    "start": 2420.32,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "multi-layered, multi multi-extured.",
    "start": 2422.079,
    "duration": 9.04
  },
  {
    "text": "like the love maybe uh the love for a",
    "start": 2426.32,
    "duration": 9.44
  },
  {
    "text": "person that one's loved for many years",
    "start": 2431.119,
    "duration": 6.801
  },
  {
    "text": "richer.",
    "start": 2435.76,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "It's hard to uh",
    "start": 2437.92,
    "duration": 7.159
  },
  {
    "text": "to summarize a love like that.",
    "start": 2440.56,
    "duration": 4.519
  },
  {
    "text": "And uh",
    "start": 2446.16,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "and the love is kind of virtuous cycle.",
    "start": 2450.32,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "The love stimulates more",
    "start": 2453.52,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "interest and curiosity. The goodness",
    "start": 2456.88,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "stimulates more interest and curiosity",
    "start": 2459.28,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "and we we keep going uh even though",
    "start": 2462.72,
    "duration": 7.48
  },
  {
    "text": "we've arrived.",
    "start": 2466.88,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "So offer this for your consideration.",
    "start": 2472.079,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Uh",
    "start": 2477.52,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "yeah, I wish you uh all well. Well, I",
    "start": 2480.079,
    "duration": 6.561
  },
  {
    "text": "won't have um class next week. I'll be",
    "start": 2483.68,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "uh doing a retreat for um young adults.",
    "start": 2486.64,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "Uh",
    "start": 2490.56,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "and um",
    "start": 2492.56,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "yeah, see you uh see you back uh",
    "start": 2496.16,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "following week. I think the 13th.",
    "start": 2499.76,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "All right. I wish you uh wish you wish",
    "start": 2503.76,
    "duration": 5.96
  },
  {
    "text": "you all well. Thanks.",
    "start": 2506.0,
    "duration": 3.72
  }
]